Calculatorg:

What is it?
Calculatorg is a simple calculator tool that is currently just web based for the time being.
The goal of this tool is to remove the hassle of using calculator tools like TI emulators
or simple 4 operation calculator apps. One is too complex for most use cases and one is too
simple, so while they both have their own time and place; the majority of the time they're
either serious underkill or overkill.

The goal of this project is to strike a happy medium between the two: to allow for complex
operations if the user needs, but not to have so many operations available that it overwhelms
the user. Ideally, the user should be able to get things done faster with my product than
any other calculator tool or emulator out there. I've designed this site to be as quick and
efficient as possible, to let people use it as quickly as they can, and then let them get back
to more important work.

If you have any feedback, please reach out to me. If you wish to contribute, again, please contact
me. Thank you for using Calculatorg and I hope I've removed a pain point from your life :)

Felix A.